==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|maddoc}}, from an unrecorded {{inh|en|ang|-}} form corresponding to Old Norse {{m|non|maðkr}} (whence dialectal English {{m|en|mawk}}, Danish {{m|da|madike}}, Swedish {{m|sv|mask}}), originally a diminutive of the {{der|en|gem-pro|*maþô||worm}} (whence Old English {{m|ang|maþa}}), equivalent to {{suffix|en|made|t1=maggot|ock}}.

===Pronunciation===
